# MASTER PROMPT: VIBE-NOVA FULL-STACK E-COMMERCE WEBSITE

Act as a senior full-stack software engineer, UI/UX designer, database architect, security engineer, and deployment specialist.

Build a complete, production-minded, full-stack e-commerce web application named **Vibe-Nova**. This is a college engineering project that must also look and behave like a professional commercial shopping website.

**Tagline:** "Your Style. Your Vibe. Your Universe."

Do not create only a landing page, static mockup, or design prototype. Build a functional application with reusable components, working navigation, persistent data, authentication, product management, shopping cart, checkout, and deployment-ready code.

First inspect the available project environment and its supported capabilities. Then implement the application directly in the project workspace. Make sensible decisions without repeatedly asking questions. Do not claim that external services work unless they have been configured and tested.

